  "ui.4b3c468804fc": [
    "先查看邮件附件，再按序号选择。文件和图片预览直接发送到本人微信；单个最多 20 MB。语音查询使用微信提供的转写文本，发信确认与附件传输须用文字。",
    "View message attachments first, then choose by number. Files and image previews are sent directly to your own WeChat account, up to 20 MB each. Voice queries use WeChat's transcription; send confirmation and attachment transfer require text."
  ],
  "ui.49eaee5b6eef": [
    "查看第一封的附件",
    "View attachments for the first message"
  ],
  "ui.525017cd9357": [
    "把第二个附件发给我",
    "Send me the second attachment"
  ],
  "ui.2be6fba397d4": [
    "预览第一个附件",
    "Preview the first attachment"
  ],
  "ui.1972b71e96c8": [
    "连接后没有收到回复？",
    "Connected but not receiving replies?"
  ],
  "ui.4a111a4f4112": [
    "先查看连接状态。电脑需要开机联网，MailAI 需要运行；在机器人单聊中发送指令。“查收邮件”完成后会尝试回传结果；若未收到反馈，发送“状态”核对同步时间。",
    "Check connection status first. Your computer must be online with MailAI running. Send commands in a private bot chat. After “Check mail”, the bot attempts to report results; if nothing arrives, send “Status” to check the sync time."
  ],
  "ui.579f31075814": [
    "运行与隐私",
    "Operation and privacy"
  ],
  "ui.0b8ce73a19fd": [
    "电脑须开机联网，MailAI 须在后台运行。微信正常退出与断线恢复时会尝试通知；突然断网、休眠或关机无法保证即时提示。只处理本人单聊，不支持群聊。微信可按序号获取附件，钉钉附件尚未接入。手机切换邮箱不会改变电脑当前邮箱。",
    "Your computer must stay online with MailAI running in the background. WeChat attempts to notify you on a normal exit or reconnection; sudden disconnection, sleep or shutdown may prevent an immediate notice. Only your private chats are supported, not groups. WeChat supports numbered attachments; DingTalk attachments are not yet supported. Switching accounts on the phone does not change the computer's account."
  ],
  "ui.8fa0e2b2f383": [
    "聊天会记住当前邮箱、列表序号、正在看的邮件和回复预览。重启后可说“继续”；闲置 30 分钟后重新查看列表，回复确认编号有效 10 分钟。",
    "Chat remembers your account, list numbers, current message and reply preview. Say “Continue” after restarting. Refresh the list after 30 minutes of inactivity; reply confirmation codes expire after 10 minutes."
  ],
  "ui.4dce62c8b957": [
    "邮件内容会经过所选聊天平台；基础指令不调用大模型。启用 AI 后，自然语言指令会交给已配置的模型；仅在你请求总结或起草时发送对应邮件主题与正文，可能产生现有 API 费用。凭证保存在 macOS 钥匙串或 Windows 凭据管理器，关闭连接即停止受理新指令。",
    "Mail content passes through the selected chat platform. Basic commands do not use an AI model. With AI enabled, natural-language commands use your configured model; a message's subject and body are sent only when you request a summary or draft, which may incur API charges. Credentials are stored in macOS Keychain or Windows Credential Manager. Disconnecting stops new commands."
  ],
